[01:23.99] I kneel and wait in silence
[01:32.42] As one by one the people slip away
[01:40.08] Into the night
[01:44.05] The quiet and empty bodies
[01:49.42] Kiss the ground before they pray
[01:53.71] Kiss the ground
[01:55.22] And slip away
[01:59.93] 
[02:22.19] I sit and listen dreamlessly
[02:30.97] A promise of salvation makes me stay
[02:37.95] Then look at your face
[02:42.34] And feel my heart pushed in
[02:47.51] As all around the children play
[02:51.95] The games they tired of yesterday
[02:57.70] They play
[03:02.07] 
[03:04.08] They play
[03:08.36] 
[03:20.86] I stand and hear my voice cry out
[03:29.48] A wordless scream at ancient power
[03:36.54] It breaks against stone
[03:41.08] I softly leave you crying
[03:46.22] I cannot hold what you devour
[03:50.65] The sacrifice of penance
[03:53.96] In the holy hour
[03:57.61] 